Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:39.14,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ashita no koto wa wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:42.56,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kore tte gisei to wa chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:44.26,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nanika ga chigau
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.26,0:02:47.88,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}batsu ge-mu ja nante omowanai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:51.13,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}de nande na no ka wa wakannai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.13,0:02:54.53,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}chotto shakuzen to shinai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.53,0:03:00.08,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi no sonzai ima daiji da nante mon ja nai
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:06.34,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}owaranai koto nante kono yo no doko ni mo nai
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:10.89,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}naku no wa tsurain ja nai no
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:13.59,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ai no Sweet Drops, Sweet Drops
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.59,0:03:17.03,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}zutto yume mite itai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.03,0:03:20.16,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}motto yasashiku shitai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:23.92,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi to iraretara Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.92,0:03:27.14,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}onna no ko tte tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.14,0:03:30.45,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}dakedo tokidoki yowai ne
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.81,0:03:37.14,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}bokura no negai wa Happy Happy Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.14,0:03:40.58,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}sonna hibi mo Happy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:48.29,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:39.14,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}We don't know what'll happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:42.56,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This feels different from a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:44.26,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Something feels different.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.26,0:02:47.88,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm not thinking of it as a punishment game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:51.13,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I still don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.13,0:02:54.53,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though I don't quite feel satisfied with that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.53,0:03:00.08,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}there's no question that you're important to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.58,0:03:06.34,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}There's nothing in this world that's endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:10.68,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Isn't it painful having to cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:13.48,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Love's sweet drops, sweet drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.59,0:03:17.03,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to keep dreaming forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.03,0:03:20.16,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to be kinder?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:23.92,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}As long as I'm with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.92,0:03:27.14,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you think girls can be strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.14,0:03:30.45,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though we can be weak sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.81,0:03:37.14,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our wish is for happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.14,0:03:40.58,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Those days can also be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:48.29,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.95,0:20:40.44,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nichiyou no hareta hirusagari
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.11,0:20:43.97,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kyou wa doko e yukou?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.37,0:20:50.93,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kayoi nareta itsumo no michi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.93,0:20:55.53,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mabushiku kagayaite mieru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.66,0:21:00.88,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}terasu atatakai taiyou to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:05.96,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}tonari ni kimi ga ireba
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.96,0:21:10.04,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.63,0:21:15.91,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}hashagidasu kimochi ni
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:20.48,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:26.79,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe wa dokomademo
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:30.95,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.61,0:21:36.57,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}maiagaru kaze ni nori
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.26,0:21:41.43,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.95,0:21:50.49,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe mo tobihaneru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.95,0:20:40.44,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}It's a sunny Sunday, early in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.11,0:20:43.97,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Where should we go today?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.37,0:20:50.93,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This path I've grown so used to taking
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.93,0:20:55.53,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}seems to be shining brightly,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.66,0:21:00.88,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}as long as the warm sun is shining
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:05.96,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}and you are here beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.96,0:21:10.04,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.63,0:21:15.91,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I feel like frolicking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:20.48,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:26.79,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our voices can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:30.95,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.61,0:21:36.57,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm riding on the rising wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.26,0:21:41.43,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.95,0:21:50.49,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even our voices will be bouncing.
