Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{editor: Can I get a couple lines split? 73 and 125}{qcer: done}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.14,0:00:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What... was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.23,0:00:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No. I was just getting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.51,0:00:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.77,0:00:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.98,0:00:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll talk to them about it on Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.83,0:00:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye.{See you}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Last night, my grandfather on my mom's side passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That dream... was it Grandpa and... Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't seem to have much of a relationship with his relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.19,0:01:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My first time back in a long while, and it's for a funeral...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:27.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.82,0:04:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Daikichi? You're early.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.30,0:04:32.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can put your luggage in your grandfather's bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.51,0:04:33.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.{Yes}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.93,0:04:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, there was a little girl out in the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.56,0:04:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did Haruko's daughter always look like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's not Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.51,0:04:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then whose kid is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.47,0:04:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really... It's so hard to work in this kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.14,0:04:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what we're going to do now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was 79, so he lived a pretty full life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That girl is apparently your grandfather's illegitimate child.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! Grandpa's child?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.45,0:05:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't tell me anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,His mistress disappeared too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mistress? He was 79!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.53,0:05:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My, it's as embarrassing as it is pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So then, wouldn't she be your little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.83,0:05:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That also means she's my aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Enough! This is nothing to joke about!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're thirty now! Don't make such insensitive remarks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.15,0:06:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've lived a full life, Grandpa. {or: You died peacefully}{Note that both are correct}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How much should I spend{give}? {Check this whole conversation}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,However much you wish. It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, surely you must have an estimate?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.91,0:06:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,However much you like is fine, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, these days a lot of people have a sutra{Buddhist scriptures} read and a posthumous Buddhist name given.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She said 400 to 500 thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.51,0:06:52.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's quite a sum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello. It's been quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Daikichi. Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.89,0:07:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you been busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.78,0:07:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, somewhat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Busy, busy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.78,0:07:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother has been wanting to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.11,0:07:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't even come back for New Year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.41,0:07:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.31,0:07:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on! Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.03,0:07:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.70,0:07:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Dai-chan. Long time, no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.55,0:07:25.39,Default,overlap,0000,0000,0000,,Mama! {overlaps with last line}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.39,0:07:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There, got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be a good girl and sit still.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.13,0:07:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.08,0:07:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.20,0:07:35.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're just so similar to your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.11,0:07:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:54.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, Mom told me earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.03,0:07:56.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it really true?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:08:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought my brother would get lonely, living by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It seems they found her baby book.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.15,0:08:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her name is Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At any rate, to do something like this at age 79...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In any case, your father seems to have managed it somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rather, I feel like he did a good job. {Check}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, could you get the cushions out of the closet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.48,0:08:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to trade with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.22,0:09:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.86,0:09:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Give it to me like it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.66,0:09:26.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.53,0:09:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, don't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.33,0:09:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My, well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.88,0:09:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It is! Reina-chan, you're really good at making a cat's cradle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.42,0:09:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you do a four-step ladder next?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.73,0:09:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, here, Reina-chan. Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.75,0:09:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Poop bomb! {What? Okay, I tried googling this... to make sure it was actually what she said, because I thought this sounded ridiculous.... And I found this link: http://dogdaysrikotta.blog94.fc2.com/blog-entry-336.html } {lol}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.61,0:09:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.48,0:10:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uncle. Hey, Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.55,0:10:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll watch over the incense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.35,0:10:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:10:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't sleep in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go rest out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.26,0:11:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What about the incense?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.57,0:11:06.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi said he'll watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, up you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Brother, I leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.35,0:11:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should go sleep over there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.77,0:11:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.10,0:11:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your face is a mess. {I lol'ed. Maybe we should edit this to not sound so... mean? XD I'm not sure how to put it though.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.82,0:11:59.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, everybody, please say your final farewells.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.95,0:12:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.16,0:12:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.61,0:12:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a farewell gift{is there a better term for this?} for your grandfather. {maybe: Say goodbye to your grandfather}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.08,0:12:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A field of flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.89,0:12:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! I'm making a flower garden! I wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.61,0:12:51.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You should go say goodbye, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.59,0:13:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Put this on Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.70,0:13:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.10,0:13:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{Gentian}Bellflowers? {http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gentiana_scabra} {edit: Maybe a note: Gentian = Rindo i.e. the girl's name}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa loved those flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa, these flowers will make you the happiest, won't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He won't... wake up anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.41,0:14:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. He's not waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.87,0:14:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You really are Grandpa's kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.03,0:16:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where did this Yoshii Masako go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.60,0:16:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone who would leave her child behind...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.56,0:16:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows what would happen even if we found her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.96,0:16:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good grief. How irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.99,0:16:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My brother's become stubborn about it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{She's just making random noises}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.37,0:16:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.64,0:16:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That girl, she can't talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.86,0:16:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's a pain. She hasn't even lost any {baby }teeth yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.21,0:16:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She can talk! She's not a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.58,0:16:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She can't talk! That's why Reina is so bored!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.82,0:16:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here! You can have them all, now go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.81,0:17:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's like a candy shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.06,0:17:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Dai-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.11,0:17:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What we need to worry about now is, who's going to look after that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it. I have to run my shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If only she was a more proper child... {explanation: like a normal child who can behave herself}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.23,0:17:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She seems slow when it comes to using words, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.96,0:17:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom, since you are staying at home, couldn't you look after her for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.36,0:17:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,O-Of course not! I don't have that kind of free time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, do you know how difficult it is to raise a child?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know how much I've had to sacrifice up until now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If she was raised half-heartedly, I'd feel bad for her.{or for her (the girl)? not sure, check please}{like if you don't take good care enough of her, she would end up be a pitiable girl}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.51,0:17:48.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't this conversation supposed to be about who will take care of Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.17,0:17:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, Brother, you don't plan to do anything on your own, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.13,0:17:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have to take a look at reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.16,0:18:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At any rate, we don't even know if she's really your grandfather's child or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.96,0:18:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, you have no idea, so you can't deny it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.59,0:18:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For the time being, why don't we just look for an institution that will take her in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.13,0:18:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.91,0:19:05.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Want to come home with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.35,0:20:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa. I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Grandp—?!{added -masat}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.59,0:20:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call me Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.91,0:20:26.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After all, you're my aunt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.12,0:22:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.55,0:22:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.64,0:22:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.95,0:22:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.22,0:22:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There aren't any more side dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.47,0:22:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can make it into a rice ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.91,0:22:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There are no ingredients for rice balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Salt!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.16,0:22:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.93,0:22:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, it's still hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.37,0:22:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, look—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.91,0:22:34.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, it'll have a gentle taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.75,0:22:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.58,0:22:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.69,0:22:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi sounds weird, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.86,0:22:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's good{delicious}.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.96,0:22:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
